=== Module 17 - Lexical Errors & Recovery ===

spec: fixtures/ajoda.tokens  (28 rules, from Module 16)

--- probe: x$y?z ---
  SKIP_ONE (one ERROR per bad character):
    IDENT(x) ERROR($) IDENT(y) ERROR(?) IDENT(z) EOF
    2 errors: 1:2 "$", 1:4 "?"
  SKIP_TO_RESTART (one ERROR per bad run):
    IDENT(x) ERROR($) IDENT(y) ERROR(?) IDENT(z) EOF
    2 errors: 1:2 "$", 1:4 "?"
  Module 16 alone: stops at 1:2: no token can start with '$'

--- probe: total = a @@@# b; ---
