    4 errors: 1:11 "@", 1:12 "@", 1:13 "@", 1:14 "#"
  SKIP_TO_RESTART (one ERROR per bad run):
    IDENT(total) ASSIGN(=) IDENT(a) ERROR(@@@#) IDENT(b) SEMI(;) EOF
