  Module 16 alone: stops at 1:11: no token can start with '@'

--- probe: let n: i64 = 5 @ 2; ---
  SKIP_ONE (one ERROR per bad character):
    LET(let) IDENT(n) COLON(:) I64(i64) ASSIGN(=) INT_LIT(5) ERROR(@) INT_LIT(2) SEMI(;) EOF
    1 error: 1:16 "@"
  SKIP_TO_RESTART (one ERROR per bad run):
    LET(let) IDENT(n) COLON(:) I64(i64) ASSIGN(=) INT_LIT(5) ERROR(@) INT_LIT(2) SEMI(;) EOF
    1 error: 1:16 "@"
  Module 16 alone: stops at 1:16: no token can start with '@'

--- probe: @@@ ---
